ription below its pre-order campaign  is live right now and this law is  written not by me but by loki who has  helped out with a lot of my videos and  he's one of dark souls most dedicated  scholars so again you can pre-order with  the link below and it should start  shipping at the start of next year so  don't miss out but before i go i want to  give a huge thanks to john devlin who  was with me for every single judgment of  every single art piece that made it into  this book and that made it into the art  competitions john was with me every step  of the way helping me judge artwork  which is like a futile endeavor really  but we did our best and i couldn't have  done it without you man  ricardo amike he helped judge a couple  of pieces so he has his own interview  alongside john here at the back of the  book  ricardo was a part of every single art  competition he judged a few he created  artwork for pretty much all of them i  think  and again  you couldn't do it without the artists  they're all listed here in the artist  index go to this page as you're reading  soul arts find these artists go to their  art station pages their portfolios  commission them give them work  you can tell they deserve it honestly  and lastly thank you to the benefactors  of soul arts who supported the project  on kickstarter and thank you to tunin  fairweather who published this  beautiful book  you
 

